        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK primary key &amp;nbsp; FK foreign key &amp;nbsp; UK unique key&lt;br&gt;Crow's foot ends: || exactly one, o| zero or one, o&amp;lt; zero or many&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enums&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;users.role: USER, ADMIN, PROFESSIONAL&lt;br&gt;form_templates.status: DRAFT, PUBLISHED, ARCHIVED&lt;br&gt;form_fields.field_type: TEXT, NUMBER, DATE, SELECT&lt;br&gt;form_submissions.status: DRAFT, SUBMITTED&lt;br&gt;customer_contacts.contact_type: PHONE, EMAIL, VISIT, MESSAGE&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;reference_code is user-facing (e.g. LA-7F42K9), not the primary key.&lt;br&gt;form_fields.options holds SELECT choices as a JSON array.&lt;br&gt;answer_value is text, validated by the backend per field_type." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=12;strokeColor=#adb5bd;fillColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#212529;"><mxGeometry x="40" y="530" width="352" height="300" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
